WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.667
Choosing a summary is a conceptual decision Counts
and proportions

00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:11.477
fit nominal categories naturally Ordinal variables
often support

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:17.342
medians and percentiles Numeric variables may use
means and standard

00:00:17.368 --> 00:00:23.377
deviations when the mean is meaningful and the
distribution is appropriate Skewed

00:00:23.403 --> 00:00:29.200
numeric data often benefits from median and
interquartile range Do

00:00:29.213 --> 00:00:33.042
not apply the same summary mechanically to every
column in a dataframe
